Tabularis OpenSearch Plugin

Copyright and license notices for dependencies distributed with this software
are provided in the accompanying licenses directory. The Go dependency notices
include the Go runtime and standard library, the OpenSearch Go client, the AWS
SDK for Go, the SQL parser, and the JavaScript runtime used by the PPL parser.
They also include the Lucent and V8 notices supplied with the JavaScript
runtime.

The PPL parser artifact contains generated grammar from OpenSearch Dashboards
and the antlr4ng runtime. Their license and notice files are included in the
licenses directory. The source revision and generation procedure are recorded
in ppl/build.sh.
